---
title: "app permission model (Current Finance: ProtocolApp)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: init() -- create AdminCap + ProtocolApp
    q_init --> q_share: share_object(ProtocolApp)

    q_share --> q_whitelist: whitelist_mut -- admin adds PackageCallerCap ID
    q_whitelist --> q_set_perms: permissions stored as u32 bitmask

    q_set_perms --> q_check_perm: ensure_has_permission(id, what)
    q_check_perm --> q_lookup: whitelist.get(cap_id)
    q_lookup --> q_mask: mask = 1 << what
    q_mask --> q_bitwise: has_perm = (permission and mask) != 0
    q_bitwise --> q_allowed: assert has_permission
    q_allowed --> [*]

    q_share --> q_validate: validate_market(market)
    q_validate --> q_check_registered: assert market_type registered
    q_check_registered --> q_check_id: assert stored_id == object::id(market)
    q_check_id --> [*]

    note right of q_check_perm
        INV-001: Permission bits: flash_loan, liquidation, adl, enter_market_with_emode
        INV-002: PackageCallerCap is per-package, not per-user
        INV-003: AdminCap is transferable, intended for governance contract
        INV-004: Version check prevents calls to outdated contract versions
        INV-005: Market validation ensures correct Market object is used
    end note
